<div id="app">
  <section class="grid overflow-hidden border border-[#d8dad3] bg-[#fffefa] lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_.95fr]">
    <div class="flex min-h-[28rem] flex-col justify-between p-7 sm:p-11 lg:p-14">
      <p class="section-kicker">TAIPEI · 當令花束與心意配送</p>
      <div class="max-w-xl py-10"><h1 class="display text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.35] text-text-primary sm:text-5xl">把今天想說的話，<br>交給一束正在盛開的花。</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-md leading-8 text-text-secondary">從清晨挑花、午後整理，到送到你在意的人手上。花漾生活用當季花材，做好一份剛剛好的心意。</p><a href="#products" class="button-primary mt-8">看看今天的花束 <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a></div>
      <div class="flex gap-8 border-t border-[#d8dad3] pt-5 text-sm text-text-secondary"><span><b class="block text-text-primary">當日配送</b>台北市區</span><span><b class="block text-text-primary">滿 NT$500</b>免運送達</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative min-h-[22rem] overflow-hidden"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487530811176-3780de880c2d?w=1200" alt="盛放的季節花束" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"><p class="absolute bottom-5 right-5 bg-[#fffefa]/90 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-text-secondary">本週花材：大理花、洋桔梗、尤加利</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="my-20"><div class="mb-8 flex items-end justify-between gap-4"><div><p class="section-kicker">本週挑選</p><h2 class="display mt-2 text-3xl font-bold">送出去的，都是好時光。</h2></div><a href="#products" class="nav-link border-b border-current pb-1">全部花束</a></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-8 md:grid-cols-4"><article v-for="(product, idx) in products.slice(0, 4)" :key="product.id" @click="goToProduct(product.id)" class="group cursor-pointer"><div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-[#e9d7d0]"><img :src="product.image_url || featuredImages[idx % 4]" :alt="product.name" class="h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"></div><div class="mt-3 flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="font-medium text-text-primary">{{ product.name }}</h3><p class="shrink-0 text-sm text-rose-primary">NT$ {{ product.price.toLocaleString() }}</p></div></article></div></section>
  <section id="products" class="border-t border-[#b9c0b8] pt-8"><div class="mb-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-end"><div><p class="section-kicker">花束目錄</p><h2 class="display mt-2 text-3xl font-bold">為每一種心情選花</h2></div><p class="max-w-md leading-7 text-text-secondary">每束花都依當日狀態完成搭配；照片是色調與份量的參考，讓季節有自己的呼吸。</p></div><div v-if="loading" class="py-20 text-center text-text-secondary">花藝師正在整理今日花材…</div><template v-else><div v-if="products.length === 0" class="paper py-16 text-center"><p class="display text-xl">今天的花架還在準備中</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary">晚一點再回來看看。</p></div><div v-else class="grid gap-x-5 gap-y-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><article v-for="product in products" :key="product.id" class="group"><button @click="goToProduct(product.id)" class="block w-full text-left"><div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-[#e9d7d0]"><img :src="product.image_url || 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1490750967868-88aa4f44baee?w=400'" :alt="product.name" class="h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"></div><h3 class="mt-4 font-bold text-text-primary">{{ product.name }}</h3></button><div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-rose-primary">NT$ {{ product.price.toLocaleString() }}</p><button @click="addToCart(product)" :disabled="product._adding || product.stock <= 0" class="text-sm font-bold text-text-primary underline decoration-[#cf7656] decoration-2 underline-offset-4 disabled:text-text-muted">{{ product.stock <= 0 ? '暫時售完' : '加入花籃' }}</button></div></article></div><div v-if="pagination.totalPages > 1" class="mt-12 flex justify-center gap-2"><button v-for="p in pagination.totalPages" :key="p" @click="loadProducts(p)" class="h-10 w-10 border text-sm" :class="p === pagination.page ? 'border-rose-primary bg-rose-primary text-white' : 'border-[#b9c0b8] text-text-secondary'">{{ p }}</button></div></template></section>
  <section class="my-20 grid border-y border-[#d8dad3] py-10 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="px-5 py-4 md:border-r md:border-[#d8dad3]"><p class="display text-xl">新鮮入店</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-text-secondary">當日挑選、清水養護，再交到花藝師手上。</p></div><div class="px-5 py-4 md:border-r md:border-[#d8dad3]"><p class="display text-xl">好好包裝</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-text-secondary">不浮誇，但能讓收到的人感覺被好好對待。</p></div><div class="px-5 py-4"><p class="display text-xl">準時抵達</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-text-secondary">台北市區提供當日配送，讓心意不必久等。</p></div></section>
</div>
